Z","updated_at":"2020-07-18T17:22:38Z","body":"Looks like the following in MultiStageAlterTable::UpdateIndexPermission wasn't executed :\r\n```\r\n      indexed_table_data.set_state(SysTablesEntryPB::ALTERING,\r\n```\r\nMaybe CatalogManager can use the state not being SysTablesEntryPB::ALTERING to infer that index was not successfully created.\r\n\r\nAnother choice is to remove index metadata from the underlying table if the index cannot be created.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/660514177/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"tedyu","id":235188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNTE4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu","html_url":"https://github.com/tedyu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/660569362","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/5139#issuecomment-660569362","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/5139","id":660569362,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY2MDU2OTM2Mg==","user":{"login":"amitanandaiyer","id":32495790,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNDk1Nzkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32495790?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer","html_url":"https://github.com/amitanandaiyer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-07-19T01:27:37Z","updated_at":"2020-07-19T01:27:37Z","body":"Looks like there are 2 issues here :\n\n1 ) D7996 implemented index removal upon backfill failure. However it only removed the index from the Index Map. The index table was to be deleted after #4039 was addressed. However, that is not yet done, although #4039 has now landed as of last week. \n\n2) The issue of running into a check failure seems to be caused by a relatively new interaction between D7996 and D8713 (which landed last week).  The issue seems to be essentially one where fully_applied_* fields are populated in preparation of sending an alter request; however the ALTERING state is only being set if there is a non-trivial change to the table schema.\n     Doing so makes sense in situations where we are waiting for the pg permissions to catch up. However, seems like it can leave the table’s info in a RUNNING state with fully_applied* fields, when it happens from a delete index code path.\n\n<sub>[View in Slack](https://yugabyte.slack.com/archives/C3SP5KNAC/p1595057982268800)</sub>","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/660569362/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":7100,"client_id":"Iv1.37ba7cd714104547","slug":"slack","node_id":"MDM6QXBwNzEwMA==","owner":{"login":"github","id":9919,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjk5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github","html_url":"https://github.com/github","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"Slack","description":"Stay updated on projects and access GitHub Copilot's AI-powered development tools—all from Slack and Teams. Connect your code to your conversations, fix bugs, and move more work forward without switching tools.\r\n\r\nCopilot uses AI. Check for mistakes. For more information, visit [responsible use of Copilot Coding Agent](https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/responsible-use/copilot-coding-agent)","external_url":"https://slack.github.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/slack","created_at":"2017-11-30T02:22:47Z","updated_at":"2025-10-28T17:33:20Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","deploym